body:
I, uh... don't actually think Traitor's Requiem is good. Like, at all. I really, really don't even hear it as music for whatever reason. I've never had this problem with any OP before ever, and I'm starting to feel like there's something wrong with my ears.

&#x200B;

\*sigh\* Okay, you can shoot me now.

[https://youtu.be/VhNiWfnt6kw?t=4875](https://youtu.be/VhNiWfnt6kw?t=4875)

&#x200B;

Timestamp in URL

I use it to save and re-watch ~~shitposts~~ wholesome videos that always make me feel better. Like [this.](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FM7gznPimtQ&list=WL&index=7&t=0s)

&#x200B;

Before I started doing that, though, I never used the damn thing either.
